#: ../../library/tracemalloc.rst:109
msgid ""
"We can see that Python has loaded ``8173 KiB`` of module data (bytecode and "
"constants), and that this is ``4428 KiB`` more than had been loaded before "
"the tests, when the previous snapshot was taken. Similarly, "
"the :mod:`linecache` module has cached ``940 KiB`` of Python source code to "
"format tracebacks, all of it since the previous snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Man sieht: Python hat ``8173 KiB`` Moduldaten geladen, Bytecode und "
"Konstanten, und damit ``4428 KiB`` mehr als vor den Tests, als der vorige "
"Snapshot entstand. Ebenso hat das Modul :mod:`linecache` ``940 KiB`` Python-"
"Quellcode zwischengespeichert, um Tracebacks zu formatieren -- alles davon "
"seit dem vorigen Snapshot."

#: ../../library/tracemalloc.rst:115
msgid ""
"If the system has little free memory, snapshots can be written on disk using "
"the :meth:`Snapshot.dump` method to analyze the snapshot offline. Then use "
"the :meth:`Snapshot.load` method reload the snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Hat das System wenig freien Speicher, lassen sich Snapshots mit der "
"Methode :meth:`Snapshot.dump` auf die Platte schreiben und später auswerten. "
"Zum Zurückladen dient die Methode :meth:`Snapshot.load`."

