#: ../../library/tracemalloc.rst:436
msgid ""
"If *inclusive* is ``False`` (exclude), match memory blocks not allocated in "
"the address space :attr:`domain`."
msgstr ""
"Ist *inclusive* gleich ``False`` (ausschließen), passen die Speicherblöcke, "
