#: ../../library/tracemalloc.rst:484
msgid ""
"If *inclusive* is ``False`` (exclude), ignore memory blocks allocated in a "
"file with a name matching :attr:`filename_pattern` at line "
"number :attr:`lineno`."
msgstr ""
